note Boundary and recovery gates. Test input construction is handwritten Omega.
fn rt_edges to void
reset
put R 0 100
put Inlen 0 159
for i ulong 159
put In i uchar 120
end
check start 1 0 1201
check eq get R 7 159 1202
cancel
put Inlen 0 160
check not start 1 0 1203
check eq get R 0 101 1204
put Inlen 0 1
put In 0 uchar 9
check not start 1 0 1205
check eq classify 0 1206
put In 0 uchar 120
check start 1 10 1207
check heard get R 0 25000 1208
check eq tick 30010 1 1209
check eq get R 1 1 1210
check eq tick 54999 0 1211
check eq tick 55000 2 1212
check not heard get R 0 55001 1213
check restore 1214
for i ulong 40
check restore add 1220 i
end
check eq get R 9 32 1260
check eq get Hlen 31 1 1261
check eq get Hist 4960 120 1262
end
fn codeinput part ulong total ulong bytes ulong crcval ulong count ulong to void
outreset
emitb 67
emitb 79
emitb 68
emitb 69
emitb 32
emitn 1
emitb 32
emitn part
emitb 47
emitn total
emitb 32
emitn bytes
emitb 32
